 and user interaction development; and search list recommendation, trends list recommendation, and Weibo app opening advertisements. Further, it provides back-end management, traffic support, and product services for better displaying and promotion of its account and content; an open application platform that allows users to log into third-party applications with their Weibo account for sharing third-party content on its platform; and Weibo Wallet, a product that enables platform partners to conduct interest generation activities on Weibo, such as handing out red envelops and coupons. It serves ordinary people, celebrities, opinion leaders, and other public figures or influencers, as well as media outlets, businesses, government agencies, charities, and other organizations. The company was formerly known as T.CN Corporation and changed its name to Weibo Corporation in 2012. The company was founded in 2009 and is based in Beijing, the People's Republic of China.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"7370","sic_desc":"Services-Computer Programming, Data Processing, Etc.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Internet Content & Information","mcap":1555107328,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"BEIJING","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"1231","cik":1595761,"state_inc":"E9","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2020-12-31","rev":513410000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":0.13,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":29042000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":5.7,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2021-12-31","rev":616287000.0,"rev_yoy":20.0,"eps":0.5,"eps_yoy":284.6,"ni":115733000.0,"ni_yoy":298.5,"nm":18.8,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2022-12-31","rev":447998000.0,"rev_yoy":-27.3,"eps":0.6,"eps_yoy":20.0,"ni":141916000.0,"ni_yoy":22.6,"nm":3